        {
          "text": "The minor in philosophy requires the completion of five philosophy courses, at least four of which must be upper-division courses. All minors must take a gateway course — PHIL 315 , PHIL 320 , PHIL 336 , PHIL 337 , PHIL 340 , PHIL 360 or PHIL 385 .",
